    "body": "Stopped before claim. The required S2 kernel is not available on upstream/main 744c0847b.\n\nThe S1 CPU twin exists from PR #2741. The camcraft-gpu crate does not exist on this main. Issue #2627 is open and has no open PR. Issue #2620 still holds the device implementation without a PR.\n\nS4 must extend the S2 kernel. Implementing S2 here would exceed the scope of issue #2628. No code or tests changed. No claim was added.\n\nOverlap check: PR #2714 changes twin_tool in crates/sim/src/stock_sim/cut_twin_work.rs. It adds the dovetail refusal. It does not supply the missing S2 kernel.\n",
